---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Scroll — Case Study" description="A never-ending book club powered by AI">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Work</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <span class="tenet">Story</span>
      <span class="tenet">AI</span>
      <span class="tenet">Clarity</span>
      <span class="tenet">Growth</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Scroll</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">A bookshelf for your best ideas</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <blockquote class="feature-quote">
        "Why do we have social networks optimised for photographs of lunch and drive-by opinions, 
        but nothing—genuinely nothing good—for the ideas that actually change how we think?"
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        People forget the best ideas they read. Book discussions are scattered across platforms. 
        Discovery is noisy, recommendations lack clear reasons, and there's no way to tell 
        who's actually read the book from who's just seen the summary.
      </p>
      <p>
        The attention economy prefers content that can be consumed in three seconds and forgotten in four. 
        A quote from Marcus Aurelius does not pair well with an advertisement for teeth-whitening strips.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Vision</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>
        <strong>Scroll</strong> is a social network for sharing memorable quotes and lessons from 
        books and longform journalism. A never-ending book club where ideas circulate, 
        where you can see what a passage meant to someone else, where the best insights rise to the top.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name is deliberate. "We're reclaiming the word. A scroll used to be a vessel for knowledge. 
        We'd like it to be one again."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Mockup Gallery -->
  <section class="section gallery-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Experience</h2>
    <div class="mockup-gallery">
      <div class="mockup-item">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/scroll/screen-welcome.png" alt="Scroll welcome screen" class="mockup-image" />
        <div class="mockup-caption">
          <strong>A Sanctuary for Readers</strong>
          <span>Privacy-first onboarding that values deep thought</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mockup-item">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/scroll/screen-interests.png" alt="Scroll interests picker" class="mockup-image" />
        <div class="mockup-caption">
          <strong>Curate Your Bookshelf</strong>
          <span>Select genres to personalise your feed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mockup-item">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/scroll/screen-goodreads.png" alt="Scroll Goodreads verification" class="mockup-image" />
        <div class="mockup-caption">
          <strong>Verified Reader Badge</strong>
          <span>Prove you've done the reading</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mockup-item">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/scroll/screen.png" alt="Scroll new post" class="mockup-image" />
        <div class="mockup-caption">
          <strong>Identify Book with AI</strong>
          <span>Paste a quote, AI finds the source</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mockup-item">
        <img src="/images/case-studies/scroll/screen-home.png" alt="Scroll home feed" class="mockup-image" />
        <div class="mockup-caption">
          <strong>The Feed</strong>
          <span>Ideas circulating, best insights rising</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <h3>1. Post a Quote</h3>
      <p>Share a passage that resonated — from a book, The New Yorker, The Economist, Harvard Business Review.</p>
      
      <h3>2. AI Identifies the Source</h3>
      <p>Paste a quote, and AI identifies the book or article. Provides "the most excellent bits" — key themes, memorable passages, ideas worth carrying forward. Spoiler-safe by default.</p>
      
      <h3>3. Join the Community</h3>
      <p>Your post routes into a community of others who've engaged with the same text. See the most upvoted quotes and lessons. Discover similar works with explained recommendations.</p>
      
      <h3>4. Earn Credibility</h3>
      <p>Link to Goodreads to prove you've read the book. Authors get verified badges. Impact badges based on upvotes. A meritocracy of insight.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Philosophy</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <blockquote class="feature-quote">
        "If you spend twenty minutes on Scroll and come away with one idea that genuinely changes 
        how you see something, that's a success. If you spend three hours on another platform and 
        can't remember a single thing you saw, that's a failure."
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        Scroll is building a "high-signal environment" — optimised not for engagement, but for the 
        quality of what you take away. The goal isn't to capture your attention, but to enrich it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Technical Depth</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AI identification</strong> — Quote recognition with confidence scores + candidate matching</li>
        <li><strong>"Excellent bits" summaries</strong> — TL;DR + key themes, spoiler-safe by default</li>
        <li><strong>Similar reads</strong> — Explainable recommendations ("because you liked X's take on Y")</li>
        <li><strong>Verification system</strong> — Goodreads integration to prove reading, author badges</li>
        <li><strong>Community architecture</strong> — Auto-created book/article communities + genre hubs</li>
        <li><strong>Trust signals</strong> — Impact badges based on upvotes, verified reader/author status</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Outcome</h2>
    <div class="case-outcome">
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">2000+</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">line PRD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">50+</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">user stories</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">MVP</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">ready to build</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="outcome-text">Complete product specification including database schema, API endpoints, AI prompting contracts, and 12-epic task breakdown. Ready for development.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">From the River</h2>
    <div class="river-items">
      <a href="/insights" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">📝</span>
        <div>
          <strong>42 years to build my first app</strong>
          <span>My journey from journalist to builder</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/im-working-on-the-zeitgeist/id1770010162?i=1000724729646" target="_blank" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">🎙️</span>
        <div>
          <strong>I'm working on the Zeitgeist</strong>
          <span>Building AI-powered content platforms</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Work</h2>
    <div class="related-items">
      <a href="/case-studies/investing-dojo" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">📊</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Investing Dojo</strong>
          <span>Same AI-powered content curation approach</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/case-studies/club-dadvice" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">👨‍👧</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Club Dadvice</strong>
          <span>Another community-focused content platform</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/story" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">→</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Story Tenet</strong>
          <span>Why narrative matters</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Want to build something like this?</h2>
    <p>From concept to complete PRD in weeks, not months.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  
  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .case-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .feature-quote {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: #111;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }
  
  .case-outcome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .outcome-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .outcome-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .related-section {
    border-top: none;
  }
  
  .related-items, .river-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .related-link, .river-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .related-link:hover, .river-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-icon, .river-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-link strong, .river-link strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .related-link span, .river-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  /* Mockup Gallery */
  .gallery-section {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .mockup-gallery {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 1rem 0 2rem;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  
  .mockup-gallery::-webkit-scrollbar {
    height: 6px;
  }
  
  .mockup-gallery::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: #222;
  }
  
  .mockup-gallery::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  
  .mockup-item {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 280px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }
  
  .mockup-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid #333;
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }
  
  .mockup-item:hover .mockup-image {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
  }
  
  .mockup-caption {
    padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .mockup-caption strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .mockup-caption span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .mockup-item {
      width: 240px;
    }
  }
</style>
